      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Avoidance of blood testing"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Avoiding her own care; requested fasting blood tests have not been completed. Timing of the request is uncertain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mood, energy, interest, and sleep"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mood described as a bit low but better than last year, and as a bit flat but okay; energy okay with some decreased interest. Sleeps 5–7 hours with broken sleep and early waking."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Alert, well-looking, mildly anxious and cooperative; occasionally tangential and vague on details. Neat appearance and good hygiene. Engaged, becoming tense and wringing hands when discussing needles. Speech normal in rate and volume, with some hesitancy recalling history. Affect constricted but reactive and congruent. Thought form largely linear, with prominent anticipatory anxiety about blood and needles. No delusions or hallucinations. Insight and judgement reasonable; recognises fear is excessive and interferes with care."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Suicidal and homicidal ideation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies current suicidal ideation, plan, or homicidal ideation. Reports a past episode of passive suicidal ideation and no past attempts."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-13",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Psychotic symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No psychotic symptoms reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-14",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Depression and anxiety screening"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Informal assessment: depressive symptoms present but mild, with function preserved; anxiety is highly situational and related to blood-injection-injury phobia. Formal PHQ-9 and GAD-7 deferred."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Work functioning"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Continues working as an administrative assistant; staff vaccination clinics and pathology pickups are very stressful because of needles, and she sometimes swaps tasks."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-16",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-16",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Ferritin"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Last iron studies were approximately 18 months ago per EMR; ferritin was low-normal, exact value not available."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-17",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-17",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Caffeine intake"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports increased coffee and cola intake; amount not quantified. Patient wonders whether this contributes to feeling more anxious."
      }
    },
